      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a little too generic. Can you make the part about the temperature fluctuations sound a bit more descriptive? Like, explain that it might feel a bit unpredictable or \"unstable\" while the technicians are working on the sensors/units, just so people aren't caught off guard if it gets warm or cold suddenly.",
